      "content": "but \"letting go\" feels impossible when everyone is always watching and pulling at me. the only time i actually feel like i'm in control is when i think about just... not being here. when i imagine just disappearing or something. it's the only thing that feels like it would actually be mine. like the only real choice i have left.",
